{"id":"tristesse","lemma":"tristesse","pos":"noun","rank":3140,"glosses":["sadness"],"ipa":"/tʁis.tɛs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-tristesse.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-tristesse.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tristesses"},"examples":[{"text":"J'ai ressenti de la tristesse.","en":"I felt sad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/472979","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"impressions"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Ses yeux étaient remplis de tristesse.","en":"Her eyes were full of sadness.","words":[{"g":"his"},{"g":"eye","l":"œil"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to fill, to fill up","l":"remplir"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Elle l'a aidé à surmonter sa tristesse.","en":"She helped him overcome his sadness.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to help","l":"aider"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to overcome"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"La mort du président a provoqué une grande tristesse.","en":"The president's death caused great sorrow.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"dead"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"president"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to provoke","l":"provoquer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null]},{"text":"Elle divorça après de longues années de tristesse.","en":"She divorced him after many years of unhappiness.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to divorce","l":"divorcer"},{"g":"after"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"long","l":"long"},{"g":"year","l":"année"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}